Cell["\<\
Refine the display of indeterminate singularities in the sector graph. \
Non-repeating singularities are marked in orange and displayed on the edges \
leaving a node. This indicates that, once a discontinuity has been taken with \
respect to that singularity, one is forced to leave that sector and move down \
the graph:\
\>", "ExampleText",
 CellID->1250265471,ExpressionUUID->"cce91621-c64a-420b-a7e0-d9d428a19e83"],

